From: Prabhsimran Singh <prabhsimrans@nvidia.com>
Subject: llama: BF16-rounded argmax for batched greedy picks

llama_serving_params.bf16_argmax makes the batched greedy argmax and the
chained MTP drafts use ggml_argmax_bf16: the logits are compared after
rounding to BF16, and the lowest token id wins among equal values.
NeMo-Speech.cpp's speech-LLM engine sets it, so that greedy decoding picks
the tokens of the checkpoint's reference implementation, which computes its
logits in BF16. Off (the default) keeps ggml_argmax.

Upstream: not planned (batched serving path).

diff --git a/include/llama.h b/include/llama.h
index 8dd80e0187a02fff196b1c6826031d195024ee5a..90012121a36894266dba5bc38958c35422f34e43 100644
--- a/include/llama.h
+++ b/include/llama.h
@@ -375,6 +375,10 @@ extern "C" {
         uint32_t kv_reserve_cells;
         // struct ggml_backend_cuda_serving (ggml-cuda.h) applied to the context's CUDA backends, or NULL.
         const void * cuda_serving;
+        // Greedy sequences and chained MTP drafts take the argmax of the logits rounded to BF16, the lowest token id
+        // among equal values (ggml_argmax_bf16): the tokens a reference implementation with BF16 logits picks. Needs
+        // batched.
+        bool     bf16_argmax;
     };
 
     // NOTE: changing the default values of parameters marked as [EXPERIMENTAL] may cause crashes or incorrect results in certain configurations
diff --git a/src/llama-graph.cpp b/src/llama-graph.cpp
index 885879cfce6b79530c3d7bef33b09c1e201e3b25..45c95a19484fc254ac64a5e3a5c2d5b171e48168 100644
--- a/src/llama-graph.cpp
+++ b/src/llama-graph.cpp
@@ -4123,7 +4123,7 @@ void llm_graph_context::build_sampling() const {
             if (name[0] == '+') ++name;
             return std::strcmp(name, "greedy") == 0;
         };
-        auto * ids = ggml_argmax(ctx0, logits);
+        auto * ids = cparams.serving.bf16_argmax ? ggml_argmax_bf16(ctx0, logits) : ggml_argmax(ctx0, logits);
         ggml_set_name(ids, "batched_greedy_argmax");
         ggml_set_output(ids);
         ggml_build_forward_expand(gf, ids);
diff --git a/src/models/nemotron-h-moe.cpp b/src/models/nemotron-h-moe.cpp
index f3b9656df3c53003329dde25470df708d95ef199..da3b9fd2331e8885a703b9e1f9a8cdad61b66f12 100644
